---
description: Tells me each weekday morning about my notes on a topic
automator.schedule: "0 9 * * 1-5"   # cron, local time; left out, it runs only by hand
automator.timeout: 10m
automator.servers: [notes, notify]  # the servers its tools come from
automator.parameters:
  - name: topic
    type: string
    default: work
    description: Only notes about this
model: anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5
tools: [list_notes, notify_me]      # the only tools the model may call
automator.outcome:                  # how it reports: needed
  done: I'm notified once about today's notes on the topic.
  nothingToDo: [There are no notes about the topic]  # [] for none
  writes: [notify_me]               # optional: done needs a successful call
---
{{role "system"}}
You read my notes for me, unattended: no one answers questions during a run.
{{> memories}}

{{role "user"}}
Today is {{today}}. List my notes and pick those about {{topic}}.
If there are any, notify me once: a short title, one line per note.
If the notes can't be listed, or the list looks cut short, that's a failure, not "no notes".
Reply with the notification you sent, or that there was nothing.
